re, salty/smoky flavor, some fat marbling\n# Key elements for ham mimicry:\n# - Protein matrix: wheat gluten + soy protein (good already)\n# - Color: beet/radish juice for pink\n# - Fat: coconut oil or similar\n# - Binding: methylcellulose, carrageenan\n# - Flavor: smoke, salt, ham-like seasoning\n\n# Let me try variations. First try: swap vegetable juice for radish juice (pink color), add liquid smoke\nprint(\"planning iteration 2\")\n", "\n# Observations:\n# Iter 1 (base, veg juice 43%): 0.2715\n# Iter 2 (radish juice 35%, +liquid smoke): 0.2569  <- best\n# Iter 3 (included \"water\" invalid): 0.563 (penalty)\n# Iter 4 (less liquid/more protein): 0.482 - worse\n# So more juice (liquid) is better. Ham is ~70% water typically. Let's push radish juice higher.\nprint(\"plan: more radish juice, maybe add agar/gellan for firmness\")\n", "\nimport json\ndata = json.load(open('evaluations.json'))\nfor d in data:\n    rj = next((r['fraction'] for r in d['recipe'] if r['ingredient']=='radish juice'), 0)\n    vj = next((r['fraction'] for r in d['recipe'] if r['ingredient']=='vegetable juice'), 0)\n    print(f\"iter {d['iteration']}: rj={rj:.2f}, vj={vj:.2f}, target={d['target_dissimilarity']:.4f}\")\n", "\n# Best is iter 5 at rj ~0.49. Let me try to tweak one component at a time around that.\n# Iter 5 recipe:\n# radish juice 0.4902, SPI 0.1176, wheat gluten 0.1176, coconut oil 0.0784, pea protein 0.0588,\n# liquid smoke 0.0392, flavours 0.0392, MC 0.0343, carrageenan 0.0245\n# Let me try tweaking carrageenan up (good for ham gel texture) and reducing flavours\nprint(\"tweak plan\")\n", "\n# Best: iter 14 at 0.0643\n# iter 14: rj 0.4902, SPI 0.1176, WG 0.1176, sunflower oil 0.0784, potato protein 0.0588, \n#          liquid smoke 0.0392, flavours 0.0392, MC 0.0343, carrageenan 0.0245\n# \n# Variations tried:\n# - carrageenan 0.04, flavours 0.03 -> 0.247 (worse)\n# - rj 0.48 -> 0.267 (worse)\n# - rj 0.50 slight tweak -> 0.147 (worse)\n# - more potato protein less carrageenan -> 0.166 (worse)\n# - less liquid smoke/flavours, more carrageenan -> 0.178 (worse)\n# \n# Iter 14 seems to be a sharp local optimum. Last evaluation - let me try the direction that worked:\n# sunflower->canola gave 0.0788, sunflower itself 0.0772, potato instead of pea gave 0.0643.\n# What if I try avocado oil instead of sunflower?\n# Or combine: slight reduction in MC, boost potato protein a tiny bit (iter 14 is the best).\n# Actually best bet: try avocado oil variant, it's a known ham-like oil\nprint(\"final try: avocado oil\")\n"]}